<p>Abbas ka maatam hai wafadar ka maatam<br />
Hai fouje hussaini ke alamdar ka maatam</p>

<p>maare gaye maqtal me kate nehr pa shaane<br />
karte hai haram sheh ke alamdar ka maatam</p>

<p>teero'n se chidi mashq jo laaye hai shahedee'n <br />
maasomo me barpa hai alamdar maatam</p>

<p>Hai qaide musibat me behen betiya'n saari<br />
ab koun kare sayyade abraar ka maatam</p>

<p>Rote the ghareebi pa jo beemaar ke chaale <br />
zanjeer bhi khud karti beemaar ka maatam</p>

<p>Paamaal umeeedei'n hui aur aas bhi tooti<br />
zainab ne kiya sheh ke wafadaar ka maatam</p>

<p>Baba ko rote rote jo qamosh ho gayi<br />
syedaaniya karti thi wo ghamquar ka maatam<br />
</p>